MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosIntro::
    .string "You shocked me!\p"
    .string "Kids shouldn't wander\n"
    .string "here in the dark.\p"
    .string "Neither should adults.\p"
    .string "I learned that today.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosDefeat::
    .string "Shocked again.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosPostBattle::
    .string "Go straight through.\p"
    .string "Don't stop.\p"
    .string "Don't look at\n"
    .string "things that glow.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshIntro::
    .string "I came to\n"
    .string "explore the cave.\p"
    .string "I found more\n"
    .string "than I wanted to.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshDefeat::
    .string "Losing stinks.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshPostBattle::
    .string "I came to\n"
    .string "show off.\p"
    .string "Now I just\n"
    .string "want to leave.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamIntro::
    .string "It's bigger in\n"
    .string "here than I thought.\p"
    .string "The walls move\n"
    .string "when you're not\n"
    .string "looking at them.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamDefeat::
    .string "I lost it.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamPostBattle::
    .string "How do you\n"
    .string "get out?\p"
    .string "Everything looks the\n"
    .string "same in the dark.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanIntro::
    .string "Don't sneak up\n"
    .string "on me!\p"
    .string "The sounds in\n"
    .string "this cave play\n"
    .string "tricks on you.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanDefeat::
    .string "My Pokemon won't do.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanPostBattle::
    .string "Something stronger lives\n"
    .string "deeper in.\p"
    .string "I'm not going\n"
    .string "to find out what.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisIntro::
    .string "I'm waiting for\n"
    .string "my friends.\p"
    .string "They went deeper\n"
    .string "into the cave.\p"
    .string "That was an hour ago.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisDefeat::
    .string "I should go look.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisPostBattle::
    .string "The fossils here\n"
    .string "are very old.\p"
    .string "Older than anyone\n"
    .string "can explain.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_KentIntro::
    .string "Suspicious men are\n"
    .string "in this cave.\p"
    .string "Team Rocket.\p"
    .string "But they're not\n"
    .string "the only suspicious\n"
    .string "thing here.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_KentDefeat::
    .string "You got me.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_KentPostBattle::
    .string "I saw them.\p"
    .string "Team Rocket.\p"
    .string "But I also\n"
    .string "saw something else.\p"
    .string "It wasn't following them.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyIntro::
    .string "You need this cave\n"
    .string "to reach Cerulean.\p"
    .string "I need this cave\n"
    .string "to find something\n"
    .string "I lost in here.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyDefeat::
    .string "Still lost.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyPostBattle::
    .string "Zubat nest here.\p"
    .string "So does something else.\p"
    .string "I haven't seen it.\n"
    .string "Only heard it.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_ZubatIsABloodsucker::
    .string "Beware.\p"
    .string "Zubat nests here.\p"
    .string "So does something\n"
    .string "that doesn't show\n"
    .string "on any map.$"

MtMoon_1F_Text_BrockHelpsExcavateFossils::
    .string "I excavate fossils\n"
    .string "here under Mt. Moon.\p"
    .string "Brock sometimes helps.\p"
    .string "Lately he refuses\n"
    .string "to come inside.\p"
    .string "He won't say why.$"
